{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113181","id":3046909106,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61nCSy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113181","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113181.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113181.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113181","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113181/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113181/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113181/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0d83637853218127a5ec81a2bad7825dfc0c3885","number":113181,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use new dock system for Shader Editor Dock","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"See #113024\r\n\r\nUpgraded the Shader Editor Dock to use the new system. I also added a `make_dock_floating()` function in `EditorDockManager` to force a dock to be floating through code.\r\n\r\nNow that this is a dock, I removed the internal floating logic and button to use the Dock methods. The dock has to be made floating by right-clicking the tab or using the shortcut. Since all docks should be made floating this is standard behavior.\r\n\r\nMy primary motive in removing the floating button is leaving the door open to refactors that might make individual shader file editors docks (ie able to edit multiple shaders on screen at once). Leaving the button in would necessitate moving almost the entirety of the plugin into a new class extending dock, which would have to be reversed if it were refactored to edit multiple shaders on screen at once.\r\n\r\nI also reordered the constructor to be more in line with the rest of the editor.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky